{"4953280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Groovekeeper: Sort the Record Shop", "steam_appid": 4953280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Record-Sorting Game</strong><br>The shop is waiting for you to pull the records out of their crates and put them away before it opens. No boss chasing you, no customer walking in every hour, no budget draining away. Just you and thousands of records waiting for a home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Calming Loop</strong><br>You open a crate, and you need to carry the records in your hands to the right shelf and put them there. Shelves are grouped by genre, so once you get used to the game, the moment you recognize a record in your hand, you already know where it belongs. That's when the game really starts for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/9a1b84dd4489d3387ca2b85debeff284.poster.avif?t=1787831128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/9a1b84dd4489d3387ca2b85debeff284.webm?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/9a1b84dd4489d3387ca2b85debeff284.mp4?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong><br>When a crate runs out, you find a rare record inside it. Put it on the turntable, and while it plays, the records in your hands sort themselves into place, and crates open all at once. If you want, you can try it out for yourself before deciding whether to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/01b4c94a74b47af98774b59bb81cee8f.poster.avif?t=1787831128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/01b4c94a74b47af98774b59bb81cee8f.webm?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/01b4c94a74b47af98774b59bb81cee8f.mp4?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contents</strong><br>5,260 records, 10 different genres (from Blues to Hip Hop to Rock &amp; Roll), and 124 different songs among them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/2182843d0350373a94093d150e6de38d.poster.avif?t=1787831128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/2182843d0350373a94093d150e6de38d.webm?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/2182843d0350373a94093d150e6de38d.mp4?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Records</strong><br>Thanks to our shop owner's fans, Golden Records from famous artists have been sent to us to display in the shop. All you have to do is take them out of the crates and put them in their spots. It'll raise both your prestige and the shop's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/646bb4d9b0ee8ba528e806346774df85.poster.avif?t=1787831128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/646bb4d9b0ee8ba528e806346774df85.webm?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/646bb4d9b0ee8ba528e806346774df85.mp4?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Deserve to Relax Too</strong><br>No losing, no budget to manage, a calm and relaxing atmosphere. Your only job is to fill the shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/92190c79a49795776a65a260a58595f9.poster.avif?t=1787831128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/92190c79a49795776a65a260a58595f9.webm?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/92190c79a49795776a65a260a58595f9.mp4?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Record-Sorting Game</strong><br>The shop is waiting for you to pull the records out of their crates and put them away before it opens. No boss chasing you, no customer walking in every hour, no budget draining away. Just you and thousands of records waiting for a home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Calming Loop</strong><br>You open a crate, and you need to carry the records in your hands to the right shelf and put them there. Shelves are grouped by genre, so once you get used to the game, the moment you recognize a record in your hand, you already know where it belongs. That's when the game really starts for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/9a1b84dd4489d3387ca2b85debeff284.poster.avif?t=1787831128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/9a1b84dd4489d3387ca2b85debeff284.webm?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/9a1b84dd4489d3387ca2b85debeff284.mp4?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong><br>When a crate runs out, you find a rare record inside it. Put it on the turntable, and while it plays, the records in your hands sort themselves into place, and crates open all at once. If you want, you can try it out for yourself before deciding whether to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/01b4c94a74b47af98774b59bb81cee8f.poster.avif?t=1787831128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/01b4c94a74b47af98774b59bb81cee8f.webm?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953280/extras/01b4c94a74b47af98774b59bb81cee8f.mp4?t=1787831128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contents</strong><br>5,260 records, 10 different genres (from Blues to Hip Hop to Rock &amp; Roll), a